# Local assistant instructions and settings, in any letter case (a single-case bracket such as [C]
# fails to match on case-insensitive checkouts, e.g. Windows with core.ignorecase).
[Cc][Ll][Aa][Uu][Dd][Ee].md
.[Cc][Ll][Aa][Uu][Dd][Ee]/

